{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01982",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 4.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Morning, come on through. What's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.38,
      "end_seconds": 20.97,
      "duration_seconds": 11.59,
      "text": "Mainly I've been feeling low most days. That's why I came. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.06,
      "end_seconds": 26.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.75,
      "end_seconds": 29.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Probably two weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.68,
      "end_seconds": 35.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Okay, would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.42,
      "end_seconds": 52.38,
      "duration_seconds": 15.96,
      "text": "Erm, you know, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. I've also had no interest in things, for one week. I've also been waking very early."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.13,
      "end_seconds": 57.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.01,
      "end_seconds": 62.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "It, It feels moderate to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.61,
      "end_seconds": 68.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Any thoughts of harming myself, panic attacks or hearing voices at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.11,
      "end_seconds": 73.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.97,
      "end_seconds": 77.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Did you notice any drinking more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.43,
      "end_seconds": 81.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No. No drinking more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.04,
      "end_seconds": 84.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.4,
      "end_seconds": 89.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Right, um, bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.02,
      "end_seconds": 93.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.17,
      "end_seconds": 96.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.27,
      "end_seconds": 100.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.62,
      "end_seconds": 107.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "I'm on amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.6,
      "end_seconds": 110.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.07,
      "end_seconds": 114.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.17,
      "end_seconds": 117.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.08,
      "end_seconds": 121.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.82,
      "end_seconds": 127.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.8,
      "end_seconds": 133.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.97,
      "end_seconds": 137.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.06,
      "end_seconds": 141.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.78,
      "end_seconds": 149.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.21,
      "end_seconds": 155.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.08,
      "end_seconds": 175.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.75,
      "end_seconds": 180.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.42,
      "end_seconds": 185.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I follow. Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.2,
      "end_seconds": 189.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.36,
      "end_seconds": 197.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.85,
      "end_seconds": 213.84,
      "duration_seconds": 15.99,
      "text": "Just my septum straightened, in my thirties. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.53,
      "end_seconds": 220.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.72,
      "end_seconds": 235.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.24,
      "end_seconds": 263.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, pulse is 80 beats a minute, blood pressure 114 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.95,
      "end_seconds": 268.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.06,
      "end_seconds": 272.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.74,
      "end_seconds": 294.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "You are tearful and speaking slowly, but you are following everything well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.97,
      "end_seconds": 300.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.31,
      "end_seconds": 326.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.63,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like a moderate depressive episode. An underactive thyroid is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.31,
      "end_seconds": 330.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.44,
      "end_seconds": 340.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a moderate depressive episode is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.64,
      "end_seconds": 356.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I want a thyroid test done, that's for low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.44,
      "end_seconds": 360.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.05,
      "end_seconds": 394.76,
      "duration_seconds": 32.71,
      "text": "Let's get a blood count, for tiredness. I'm going to put you on sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day in the morning, long term. That's for low mood. Try a short walk each day and keep a regular sleep routine. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. I'd like to see you again in two weeks. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.58,
      "end_seconds": 399.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}